file tools/fixtures/t/topology_revocation_control.sh two plants for the new leg, the blind-size assertions written from the pen rather than the guess, and %487's trap repaired on touch
file external-research/20260906-010402_the-ring-and-the-ladder.md erratum: the second reading landed, and what the torus's remaining arms now cost
file active-designing/20260906-034951_the-revocation-and-the-fault-ride-one-edge.md erratum: the ladder column was the fallen ladder, and the identity survived the correction
